      section: "CS",
      q: "An IP router implementing Classless Inter-domain Routing (CIDR) receives a packet with address 131.23.151.76. The router's routing table has the following entries:\nPrefix | Output Interface Identifier\n131.16.0.0/12 | 3\n131.28.0.0/14 | 5\n131.19.0.0/16 | 2\n131.22.0.0/15 | 1\nThe identifier of the output interface on which this packet will be forwarded is ______.",
      options: [],
      answer: 1,
