      q: "Consider the basic block given below.\na = b + c\nc = a + d\nd = b + c\ne = d - b\na = e + b\nThe minimum number of nodes and edges present in the DAG representation of the above basic block respectively are",
      options: ["6 and 6","8 and 10","9 and 12","4 and 4"],
